OL,3,ATravel disruption as 30k expected to
OL,4,Atake part in Cardiff Half Marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FWidespread road closures are in place
OL,7,Fto accommodate the 13.1 mile (21km)
OL,8,Froute, with the race due to start on
OL,9,FCastle Street at 10:00 BST.
